        "Order can change the answer. Research on language models used as judges found that the ranking of candidate answers can be changed just by changing their order ([Wang et al., Large Language Models are not Fair Evaluators](https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.17926)). When people are the thing being ranked, that matters.",
